READING RULE FOR THE THESIS
  Unadjusted model = TOTAL RA signal -> the correct basis for a DIAGNOSTIC claim.
  Adjusted model   = signal NOT explained by leukocyte composition -> the
                     only basis on which a CELL-INTRINSIC or mechanistic
                     claim may be made for a gene.
  Composition is plausibly a MEDIATOR (RA -> neutrophilia -> transcriptome),
  so the adjusted estimate is deliberately conservative and is NOT the
  'unconfounded' estimate. Report both; never silently substitute one.

